      "repeat_attempts": 1,
      "pdf_ref": "2.4",
      "notes": "从严解释：断言要求调用次数 ≥1 且全部函数名 ⊆ allowed_tools 集合（04节，PDF 原文未明确要求至少调用一次）；allowed_tools 请求 schema 假设为 OpenAI 现行草案格式 {type:allowed_tools, allowed_tools:{mode, tools}}，需在 P1 联调时对照供应商实际 schema 核实",
      "request_template": {
        "method": "POST",
        "body": {
          "model": "{{model_key}}",
          "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "{{prompts.weather_query}}" }],
          "tools": ["{{fixtures.tools.get_weather}}"],
          "tool_choice": {
            "type": "allowed_tools",
            "allowed_tools": { "mode": "auto", "tools": [{ "type": "function", "function": { "name": "get_weather" } }] }
          },
          "stream": false
        }
      }
